Lecture 7: Dynamic Programming Part 1

This directory contains materials related to Lecture 7 (Dynamic Programming) and Homework 6 for the CSCI 570 course. All files are organized for review, compilation, and reference.

Files included:

1. homework.cc
   Source code implementation for Homework 6.
   Contains dynamic programming solutions discussed in lecture and tested examples corresponding to HW6.md.

2. HW6.md
   Detailed homework write-up for Homework 6.
   Includes problem statements, algorithmic explanations, and analysis notes.

3. ungraded_homeworks_and_discussions.md
   Supplementary materials for lecture discussions.
   Includes additional ungraded problems, discussion notes, and review exercises for deeper understanding.

4. assets/
   Supporting resources such as figures or diagrams referenced in homework or lecture materials.

The directory follows a consistent structure for clarity and maintainability.  
Compilation can be performed using the provided makefile (not listed here).